{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e115118b-42d5-82d4-94d8-97e82d675218",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:07:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:04:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, water and sewer billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Oh, a real person. It is nice to hear a voice that is not a recording. I called two times before and only got the machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you got me now. What's going on with your account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My water bill is very high this time. We had a pipe broken in the basement, the one from the wall. After the storm, the nor'easter that ended Saturday, three days ago. Pipe broke Sunday morning. I fix it already, plumber come Sunday. But the bill is high, so I want to ask about a leak adjustment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:04:55-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear about the pipe. So a leak adjustment is basically a request to review a bill when a lot of water went through the meter because of a leak that's now repaired. Usually they want to know when it was fixed and often a copy of the plumber's invoice. Whose name is the account under?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The account is in my wife name. Her name, Maria Souza. She pass away, so is not my name. I am the renter, I pay the bill every month but the name is hers. Maybe two years now the account like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all right. You can still call about it, and we can talk about updating the name on the account so it's in yours. Is that a house you rent, with the landlord, or is the water billed to you directly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Billed to me directly. Is mail to my house. I am the one who pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Here's what I'd do. Send in the plumber's invoice showing the repair date, plus a note asking for the adjustment, and include the account number from the top of the bill. A billing person reviews it. I can take your information and have somebody follow up too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please follow up. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-zero. Zero-one-seven-zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-zero. And it's Antonio?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Antonio Souza. S-O-U-Z-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more question. The bill is due, I think, tonight or tomorrow. I work all day, I cannot come to City Hall before it close. If I drop the payment in the box tonight, it count as on time? Tonight, in the box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a drop box for payments, so you can put it in tonight. Generally what matters is that it's in the box by the due date, and they collect it the next business day. If you want to be safe, you can also pay online through the city website, and that works any hour, even weekends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, any hour. Okay. And if I pay the box, I write the check, and I write the account number on the check?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, account number on the check and put the stub in with it if you have it. That helps them match it right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, account number on check, with the stub. And the high amount, I pay it all or I wait for the adjustment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's one I'll have billing answer when they call you, since it depends on how they handle the review. I'll put a note that you're asking about it and that you plan to pay tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. Thank you very much, Tony. Really, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Souza. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
